          "message": "The phase doesn't run `runHook preInstall`",
          "suggestion": null,
          "fixable": false,
          "help": "Use `runHook preInstall`. Overriding a phase skips its hooks unless it runs them: `preInstall`/`postInstall` from the derivation and from setup hooks. Leave them out only on purpose."
