          "suggestion": null,
          "fixable": false,
          "help": "Use `runHook postInstall`. Overriding a phase skips its hooks unless it runs them: `preInstall`/`postInstall` from the derivation and from setup hooks. Leave them out only on purpose."
        }
      ]
    }
